  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The metrics are currently configured so that they produce 1-minute metrics. This may be overkill. This should be configurable based on what the user wants.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Relevant code: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/pull/1756/files#diff-1bb0e31bcc42ee385f7808be46f185ac7fd4003fbe7c5c6418d2b4369f31f34eR58"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/pull/1756/files#diff-1bb0e31bcc42ee385f7808be46f185ac7fd4003fbe7c5c6418d2b4369f31f34eR58",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The step interval and the Prometheus pull interval should be the same or similar. I believe that sub 1-minute intervals are necessary to produce 1-minute metrics.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Likely, we'll want to change the configuration so that it uses the default interval, which I think is 1 minute and results in 5-minute metrics, by default, and allow users to change the frequency as they see fit.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
