  "description": "<p>The metrics are currently configured so that they produce 1-minute metrics. This may be overkill. This should be configurable based on what the user wants.</p>\n\n<p>Relevant code: <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/pull/1756/files#diff-1bb0e31bcc42ee385f7808be46f185ac7fd4003fbe7c5c6418d2b4369f31f34eR58\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/pull/1756/files#diff-1bb0e31bcc42ee385f7808be46f185ac7fd4003fbe7c5c6418d2b4369f31f34eR58</a></p>\n\n<p>The step interval and the Prometheus pull interval should be the same or similar. I believe that sub 1-minute intervals are necessary to produce 1-minute metrics.</p>\n\n<p>Likely, we'll want to change the configuration so that it uses the default interval, which I think is 1 minute and results in 5-minute metrics, by default, and allow users to change the frequency as they see fit.</p>",
